Animania Reborn is a modern reimplementation derived from the Animania project:
https://github.com/capnkirok/animaniamod

The original project is licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License
version 3. Copyright remains with the original authors and contributors.
The original mod metadata credits RazzleberryFox, Purplicious_Cow, cy4n,
Tschipp, ZeAmateis, Timmypote, Raptorfarian, vroulas, and TheJurassicAlien.
The upstream repository is hosted by capnkirok.

Upstream reference: branch 1.12, commit
32ae2b4c56cb84284e865dae0d3b78770992ba1d.

This is an unofficial Forge 1.20.1 adaptation, not an official release
by the original Animania team. The port rewrites the platform integration,
registries, entities, AI and rendering for modern Minecraft while deriving
gameplay and converted model/animation resources from the original project.
See PORTING.md for the implementation notes and differences from 1.12.

Port source and maintenance: https://github.com/Steveaaaaa/Animania-Reborn

This port preserves the original `animania` resource namespace for world and
resource-pack compatibility where practical. New implementation code is also
distributed under LGPL-3.0-only.

LICENSE contains LGPLv3; COPYING contains the incorporated GPLv3 terms.

Simmental textures reuse the original Jersey cattle textures from Animania
1.4.4, upstream commit 48129f3d. These assets retain the original authorship
and license; Simmental is an addition made by this port.

Fighting cattle textures are the Angus textures from Animania 0.9.8 BETA,
CurseForge file 2383989, credited in its metadata to RazzleberryFox,
Purplicious_Cow and cy4n. Original JAR SHA-256:
f8a9b60302b1bcb327ea8028181b4908f5a08bf214d39ea529ace55569a5dbbe.
